{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06248","headline":"酬王维 · 苑咸","name":"酬王维","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莲花梵字本从天，华省仙郎早悟禅。\n三点成伊犹有想，一观如幻自忘筌。\n爲文已变当时体，入用还推间气贤。\n应同罗汉无名欲，故作冯唐老岁年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苑咸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06248.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06248","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}